# Master Signal Table

Maintained by the Orchestrator agent (weekly, Fridays). Status: NEW / UPDATED / UNCHANGED.

**Last triangulation:** 2026-06-13 (first full orchestrator run — all rows NEW).
**Confidence rule:** High requires 2+ independent agents confirming the same bank/theme. Single-agent findings cap at Medium. Each row traces to a dated, linked source in an agent's findings file (agent number in the Source column).

## How to read confidence here

A row is **High** only when two or more agents working from different evidence types (a bank's own disclosure, a tender notice, a regulator's statistic, a job posting, a vendor's earnings) independently point at the same need. That cross-check is what the Orchestrator adds on top of each agent's own Medium-capped work.

